From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tiberiu Chibici <chibicitiberiu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:18:58 +0200
Subject: --no-launchers: no menu entry or icon in the ScummVM games' packages
 either

A ScummVM game's data package (dayofthetentacle-*-data, loom-*-data, ...)
gets /usr/share/applications/<package>.desktop, a link into
game-data-packager-runtime's ScummVM entries, and a pixmap or hicolor
icon (copied from gdp's data, or a link to the runtime's scummvm.svg; with
downloads on, one fetched from ScummVM's icon collection). Walnut ships
its own launcher per game and edition, which starts the game directly;
the link would be a second entry, broken without the runtime, and the
import refuses a link it does not know. With --no-launchers these
packages carry the data files only, and no Recommends on the runtime;
without it nothing changes.

Forwarded: not yet (goes with --no-launchers)

diff --git a/doc/game-data-packager.6 b/doc/game-data-packager.6
--- a/doc/game-data-packager.6
+++ b/doc/game-data-packager.6
@@ -129,10 +129,10 @@ If files are downloaded, save them to \fIDIRECTORY\fR.
 .TP
 .B \-\-no\-launchers
 Do not put menu entries (.desktop files) or their icons into the packages.
-The Doom family (Doom, Heretic, Hexen and related games) writes them, and any
-game made from a GOG.com setup_*.exe gets the installer's icon as
-/usr/share/pixmaps/gdp-PACKAGE.png; use this when another package provides
-the launchers.
+The Doom family (Doom, Heretic, Hexen and related games) and the ScummVM
+games write them, and any game made from a GOG.com setup_*.exe gets the
+installer's icon as /usr/share/pixmaps/gdp-PACKAGE.png; use this when another
+package provides the launchers.
 .TP
 \fB\-\-progress\-fd\fR \fIFD\fR
 Write machine-readable progress to file descriptor \fIFD\fR, one line per
diff --git a/game_data_packager/command_line.py b/game_data_packager/command_line.py
--- a/game_data_packager/command_line.py
+++ b/game_data_packager/command_line.py
@@ -273,7 +273,7 @@ def run_command_line() -> None:
         '--no-launchers', action='store_false', dest='launchers',
         help=(
             'do not put menu entries (.desktop files) or their icons in '
-            'the packages (the Doom family writes them)'
+            'the packages (the Doom family and the ScummVM games write them)'
         ),
     )
 
diff --git a/game_data_packager/games/scummvm_common.py b/game_data_packager/games/scummvm_common.py
--- a/game_data_packager/games/scummvm_common.py
+++ b/game_data_packager/games/scummvm_common.py
@@ -199,6 +199,12 @@ class ScummvmTask(PackagingTask):
 
         assert package.name.endswith('-data'), package.name
 
+        # --no-launchers: no menu entry (the .desktop link into
+        # game-data-packager-runtime), pixmap or icon, and no Recommends on
+        # the runtime that only those need
+        if not self.launchers:
+            return
+
         package.relations['recommends'].append(
             PackageRelation(
                 'game-data-packager-runtime (>= %s~)' % GAME_PACKAGE_VERSION
